        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Revise a passage from a published source, using as a model our revision of the passage from Strunk and White's The Elements of Style (pp. 121–122). Pick a long paragraph or section (about 200 words). Now, shorten it to about 150 words, 100 words, 50 words. What does that passage gain or lose with each of these revisions? Now do the same with a passage from your own writing.",
            "block_bbox": [
