        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Every piece of writing needs some metadiscourse, but too much buries your ideas. Have a reader go through several pages of your writing and highlight all the metadiscourse. With your reader, address the following questions: Which instances of metadiscourse are useful, and which are unnecessary? Are there places without metadiscourse where some would be helpful? Revise as necessary.",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
